{"id":"c5b8fc1c7772","path":"/it/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/job-profiles","lang":"it","title":"Job Profiles","description":"","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Master","MDFC","Career Prospects"],"image":null,"words":101,"alternates":{"it":"/it/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/job-profiles","en":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/job-profiles"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"MDFC","path":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"Career Prospects","path":null},{"label":"Job Profiles","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Digital fashion communication is a vivid and constantly evolving market. The rapid pace of business and technology advancements are challenging both companies and their employees in keeping up with the required skill set.</p> <p>Typical job profiles in the domain include but are not limited to, social media manager, digital marketing manager, data analyst, eCommerce manager, online communication strategist, and visual merchandiser.</p> <p>The first generation of our Master students are currently doing their internships/having their first employments in the following departments/roles:</p> <ul> <li>(Digital) Marketing and Communication </li> <li>PR</li> <li>Social Media &amp; Community management</li> <li>Digital content</li> <li>eCommerce</li> <li>SEO</li> <li>CRM and Marketing Intelligence</li> <li>Corporate visual merchandising</li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"}],"nav":[{"label":"Overview","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"Partners","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/partners"},{"label":"Key facts","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/key-facts"},{"label":"Why this Master","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/why-this-master"},{"label":"Digital Fashion Communication","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/what-is-digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"What is a Double Degree?","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/double-degree"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/structure-and-contents/experiential-learning"},{"label":"Employability","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects"},{"label":"Job Profiles","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/job-profiles"},{"label":"Employers","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/employers"},{"label":"Career Stories","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/career-stories"},{"label":"Career Mentoring","href":"/en/university/info/career/events/career-mentoring/digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"Application and admission","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/admission/academic-requirements"},{"label":"Fees and Grants","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/fees-and-grants"},{"label":"Practical information","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/organising-your-studies"},{"label":"Open days and study advisory","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/open-days-study-advisory"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/contacts"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/faq"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/it/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/job-profiles","fetchedAt":"2026-10-09T20:01:55.484Z"}